{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟宣佈，其人工智能醫療診斷系統Diagnostic Orchestrator在複雜病例測試中取得了優於人類醫生的成績。微軟AI行政總裁穆斯塔法·蘇萊曼表示，公司正在朝着醫療超級智能的目標邁進，並預計未來幾年內，人工智能系統在醫學領域的表現有望達到與人類專家難以區分的水平。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583432.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:59:37.612892+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:54:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_hash":"82c36dac55ce1579430fbf2187efe5367ed1ea5e61d0d1fe2b94c0388942e9c7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}